sequenceDiagram
  actor A as Target admin
  participant E as PackageExporter
  participant I as PackageImporter
  participant T as Deployment transaction
  participant C as CostConfigStore
  participant R as RunningAnalysis
  E->>I: Package via existing encrypted channel (C02-C03)
  I->>I: Verify deployment permission
  alt Permission denied
    I-->>A: Denied; no writes
  else Authorized
    I->>I: Compare base and target revision (C04)
    alt Mismatch without explicit authorized force
      I-->>A: Visible conflict; no writes
    else Match or explicit authorized admin force
      Note over A,I: Force is existing explicit choice, never automatic
      I->>T: Validate all included configuration (C05)
      alt Invalid data or proposed total-count limit exceeded
        T-->>I: Reject; retain prior state
        I-->>A: Validation failure; no writes
      else Valid and revision guard retained
        opt Cost section present
          T->>C: Cost definitions in atomic deployment commit (C06)
        end
        Note over T,C: Absent section leaves costs unchanged; all included changes commit together
        T-->>I: Deployment committed
        I-->>A: Deployment outcome
      end
    end
  end
  Note over C,R: At the next ordinary scheduled run, not triggered by deployment
  R->>C: Read current committed cost configuration (C07)
  C-->>R: Current definitions; prior settings if import failed
